// 对话状态机——TalkCat 行为骨架（CH4 语料提炼形态；llm.chat 迁走——probe.sink 占位，LLM 族 CH4 介入重生）
§ 'S_Talk' = { 'Idle', 'Thinking', 'Done' }
§ 'P_Go' ⇐
§ 'P_Fail' ⇐
§ 'T_Start' [t=30] : 'P_Go' & 'S_Talk' = 'Idle' → 'probe.sink'["hi", 0] | 'S_Talk' = 'Thinking' | 'S_Talk' = 'Done'
§ 'T_Retry' : 'P_Fail' & 'S_Talk' = 'Thinking' → 'probe.sink'["retry", 0] | 'S_Talk' = 'Thinking' | 'S_Talk' = 'Done'
